        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Burrowed Ambush"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The aigamuxa is Hiding in dirt, sand, or another soft surface\n\nThe aigamuxa makes a claw Strike against a creature within reach. On a hit, the aigamuxa automatically Grabs the creature. Whether or not they hit, the aigamuxa then Strides. If they have a creature grabbed, the creature moves with the aigamuxa."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
